{"1077660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drift", "steam_appid": 1077660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/4f770c62e7ae40252bcf9ef862904a3e.poster.avif?t=1786648989\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/4f770c62e7ae40252bcf9ef862904a3e.webm?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/4f770c62e7ae40252bcf9ef862904a3e.mp4?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an inter-planetary survey engineer, stranded on a desolate orbital outpost in deep space, fighting to survive a mission devastated by catastrophic failures: the horrific death of your sole crew mate, life-threatening system malfunctions, and the total loss of communication to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut off from all human contact, with only the station’s omni-present AI for company, you begin to experience inexplicable, terrifying encounters that are somehow tied to your own tormented past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have no choice but to face the terrors alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/0dd2dac654c6260801256f3c7c1a0568.avif?t=1786648989\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras_big/0dd2dac654c6260801256f3c7c1a0568.webp?t=1786648989 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/74fca54b115340f2383f890ded125ffa.poster.avif?t=1786648989\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/74fca54b115340f2383f890ded125ffa.webm?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/74fca54b115340f2383f890ded125ffa.mp4?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRIFT is a hard sci-fi, psychological horror story set in a far-future, post-AGI world. Humanity has colonized the stars; AI systems, harnessed and bound by humans, have ushered in advanced, post-scarcity technology and autonomous machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But colonizing new worlds involves probing hitherto unexplored systems in uncharted space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what you might find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/dd1b8eb02c5c8c503b969d93a38678e0.avif?t=1786648989\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras_big/dd1b8eb02c5c8c503b969d93a38678e0.webp?t=1786648989 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/42e3c134db3b70d8f9806ac5385a9fc2.poster.avif?t=1786648989\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/42e3c134db3b70d8f9806ac5385a9fc2.webm?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/42e3c134db3b70d8f9806ac5385a9fc2.mp4?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the labyrinthine expanse of the OSS Anvesha; execute grueling mission objectives, make harrowing choices, grapple with your own treacherous senses as you investigate the dark depths of the station to solve its terrifying mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/e802e291a8379077c38563284f2fee3a.avif?t=1786648989\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras_big/e802e291a8379077c38563284f2fee3a.webp?t=1786648989 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/10e8e38a4e06cc9c54ba0924e40440b6.poster.avif?t=1786648989\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/10e8e38a4e06cc9c54ba0924e40440b6.webm?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/10e8e38a4e06cc9c54ba0924e40440b6.mp4?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the lethal fallout of an interstellar mission gone terribly wrong; brave the horrors that stalk the shadowy halls of the station. How far will you go to unearth the truth and survive the dark forces that seek to destroy you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person sci-fi horror adventure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A terrifyingly realized world:</strong> Explore a highly-detailed, desolate space station. Restore its failing systems to stave off catastrophe as you fight to preserve your sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thrilling narrative-driven experience:</strong> Piece together a compelling story as you delve into the darkness at the heart of the station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hard sci-fi setting:</strong> Set over a century in the future, in a post-AGI, post-scarcity universe where the technology sustaining human life breeds absolute reliance on AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/4f770c62e7ae40252bcf9ef862904a3e.poster.avif?t=1786648989\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/4f770c62e7ae40252bcf9ef862904a3e.webm?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/4f770c62e7ae40252bcf9ef862904a3e.mp4?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an inter-planetary survey engineer, stranded on a desolate orbital outpost in deep space, fighting to survive a mission devastated by catastrophic failures: the horrific death of your sole crew mate, life-threatening system malfunctions, and the total loss of communication to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut off from all human contact, with only the station’s omni-present AI for company, you begin to experience inexplicable, terrifying encounters that are somehow tied to your own tormented past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have no choice but to face the terrors alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/0dd2dac654c6260801256f3c7c1a0568.avif?t=1786648989\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras_big/0dd2dac654c6260801256f3c7c1a0568.webp?t=1786648989 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/74fca54b115340f2383f890ded125ffa.poster.avif?t=1786648989\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/74fca54b115340f2383f890ded125ffa.webm?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/74fca54b115340f2383f890ded125ffa.mp4?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRIFT is a hard sci-fi, psychological horror story set in a far-future, post-AGI world. Humanity has colonized the stars; AI systems, harnessed and bound by humans, have ushered in advanced, post-scarcity technology and autonomous machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But colonizing new worlds involves probing hitherto unexplored systems in uncharted space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what you might find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/dd1b8eb02c5c8c503b969d93a38678e0.avif?t=1786648989\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras_big/dd1b8eb02c5c8c503b969d93a38678e0.webp?t=1786648989 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/42e3c134db3b70d8f9806ac5385a9fc2.poster.avif?t=1786648989\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/42e3c134db3b70d8f9806ac5385a9fc2.webm?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/42e3c134db3b70d8f9806ac5385a9fc2.mp4?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the labyrinthine expanse of the OSS Anvesha; execute grueling mission objectives, make harrowing choices, grapple with your own treacherous senses as you investigate the dark depths of the station to solve its terrifying mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/e802e291a8379077c38563284f2fee3a.avif?t=1786648989\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras_big/e802e291a8379077c38563284f2fee3a.webp?t=1786648989 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/10e8e38a4e06cc9c54ba0924e40440b6.poster.avif?t=1786648989\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/10e8e38a4e06cc9c54ba0924e40440b6.webm?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/extras/10e8e38a4e06cc9c54ba0924e40440b6.mp4?t=1786648989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the lethal fallout of an interstellar mission gone terribly wrong; brave the horrors that stalk the shadowy halls of the station. How far will you go to unearth the truth and survive the dark forces that seek to destroy you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person sci-fi horror adventure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A terrifyingly realized world:</strong> Explore a highly-detailed, desolate space station. Restore its failing systems to stave off catastrophe as you fight to preserve your sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thrilling narrative-driven experience:</strong> Piece together a compelling story as you delve into the darkness at the heart of the station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hard sci-fi setting:</strong> Set over a century in the future, in a post-AGI, post-scarcity universe where the technology sustaining human life breeds absolute reliance on AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Stranded on a desolate deep-space outpost, your mission gone horrifically wrong, you must now face an unspeakable, monstrous foe. Explore the station's dark recesses, survive terrifying encounters, and confront your own tormented past in this narrative sci-fi horror experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/9680809faec3a78e456c0b3cf69689abe6d8e839/header.jpg?t=1786648989", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/347d5977f3378ff80863f122ac70c8f7be1e6875/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786648989", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077660/347d5977f3378ff80863f122ac70c8f7be1e6875/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786648989", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (version 1903 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB or AMD RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700 or AMD Ryzen 7 3700X <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070 or AMD RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 or SteamOS 3.0 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB or AMD RX 580 8GB (Mesa 21.0+ or NVIDIA 470+)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Linux support is experimental. Tested with Vulkan backend only. Performance m